      ],
      "at": [328, 69]
    },
    {"id": "crumhg", "kind": "toc", "of": "checks", "title": "Summary of checks", "at": [0, 186]},
    {
      "id": "crkthf",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Make this report your own: replace the data and the text. Headings, captions, cross-references and the summary above number and update themselves.",
      "at": [0, 266]
    },
    {
      "id": "crpvwv",
      "kind": "table",
      "header": {"row": true},
      "caption": {"text": "Revisions", "position": "above"},
      "columns": [{"width": 50}, {"width": 110}, {"width": 300}, {"width": 80}, {"width": 80}],
      "rows": [
        ["Rev.", "Date", "Description", "By", "Checked"],
        ["A", "YYYY-MM-DD", "First issue", "AE", "—"]
      ],
      "at": [0, 314]
    },
    {"id": "crneyh", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Scope", "at": [0, 409]},
    {
      "id": "crbnay",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Check of a flat steel hanger that carries a suspended platform, in tension, at the ultimate limit state. Its end connections are checked separately.",
      "at": [0, 441]
    },
    {"id": "cryyfy", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Design basis", "at": [0, 501]},
    {
      "id": "crbjti",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "- EN 1990:2002+A1:2005, Basis of structural design: combination (6.10).\n- EN 1993-1-1:2005, Design of steel structures, general rules: tension, 6.2.3.\n- National annex values are taken as the recommended values.\n- The hanger has one 22 mm bolt hole at each end and carries axial tension only.",
      "at": [0, 533]
    },
    {"id": "crawxk", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Data", "at": [0, 627]},
    {"id": "crbvfq", "kind": "text", "text": "## Material and section", "at": [0, 663]},
    {"id": "crqduw", "kind": "math", "expr": "f.y:=355 MPa", "note": "S355, t ≤ 40 mm", "at": [0, 691]},
    {"id": "crztkb", "kind": "math", "expr": "f.u:=510 MPa", "note": "EN 1993-1-1, Table 3.1", "at": [330, 691]},
    {"id": "crvuhg", "kind": "math", "expr": "γ.M0:=1.0", "note": "6.1(1)", "at": [0, 731]},
    {"id": "crxzac", "kind": "math", "expr": "γ.M2:=1.25", "note": "6.1(1)", "at": [330, 731]},
    {"id": "criuqq", "kind": "math", "expr": "b:=100 mm", "note": "flat 100 × 10", "at": [0, 769]},
    {"id": "crwvks", "kind": "math", "expr": "t.p:=10 mm", "at": [220, 769]},
    {"id": "crmmce", "kind": "math", "expr": "d.0:=22 mm", "note": "bolt hole", "at": [440, 769]},
    {"id": "crsmac", "kind": "text", "text": "## Loads", "at": [0, 810]},
    {
      "id": "crhent",
      "kind": "table",
      "name": "loads",
      "header": {"row": true},
      "caption": {"text": "Hanger force", "position": "above"},
      "columns": [{"width": 230}, {"width": 120, "align": "right"}, {"width": 70, "align": "right"}, {"width": 120, "align": "right"}],
      "rows": [
        ["Action", "Characteristic", "γ", "Design"],
        ["Permanent: platform and plant", "80 kN", "1.35", "=B2*C2"],
        ["Variable: imposed", "60 kN", "1.5", "=B3*C3"],
        ["Total", "=SUM(B2:B3)", "", "=SUM(D2:D3)"]
      ],
      "at": [0, 838]
    },
    {"id": "crupkc", "kind": "math", "expr": "N.Ed:=loads[4, 4]", "show": "value", "note": "design tension, EN 1990 (6.10)", "at": [0, 965]},
    {"id": "crfcup", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Calculations", "at": [0, 1013]},
    {
      "id": "crijpd",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "A:=b*t.p",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "mm^2", "decimals": 0},
      "note": "gross area",
      "at": [0, 1045]
    },
    {
      "id": "crbzkm",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "A.net:=(b-d.0)*t.p",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "mm^2", "decimals": 0},
      "note": "net area",
      "at": [330, 1045]
    },
    {
      "id": "crketf",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "N.pl.Rd:=A*f.y/γ.M0",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kN", "decimals": 1},
      "note": "gross section yielding, (6.6)",
      "at": [0, 1083]
    },
    {
      "id": "crkhic",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "N.u.Rd:=0.9*A.net*f.u/γ.M2",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kN", "decimals": 1},
      "note": "net section fracture, (6.7)",
      "at": [0, 1145]
    },
    {
      "id": "crwmya",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "N.t.Rd:=min(N.pl.Rd, N.u.Rd)",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"unit": "kN", "decimals": 1},
      "note": "6.2.3(2)",
      "at": [0, 1204]
    },
    {"id": "crhhjf", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Checks", "at": [0, 1257]},
    {"id": "crcznv", "kind": "math", "expr": "N.Ed<=N.t.Rd", "note": "tension, 6.2.3 (6.5)", "at": [0, 1289]},
    {
      "id": "crbjmq",
      "kind": "math",
      "expr": "η:=N.Ed/N.t.Rd",
      "show": "value",
      "display": {"decimals": 2},
      "note": "utilisation",
      "at": [0, 1324]
    },
    {"id": "crumyz", "kind": "text", "style": {"size": 12}, "text": "# Conclusion", "at": [0, 1389]},
    {
      "id": "craxzu",
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The 100 × 10 flat in S355 is adequate in tension, with a utilisation of $`η =`; net section fracture governs.",
      "at": [0, 1421]
    }
  ]
